# MISCHIEF FACE - cheeky expressions, front view. Every frame is base.pet `sit`
# with only the expression changed (same head, body, tail; feet on row 15).
# blep: wink + tongue, then > < squeeze (2x3 k chevrons over the eye columns,
#   tips pointing in, cheeks left exactly as sit) with a longer tongue.
# snicker: ^ ^ giggle behind a raised cream paw held at the mouth corner
#   (w row 8, W underside row 9, k rim) with a 2 px O/o forearm, k-edged on its
#   cream side, running down to the viewer's-right shoulder; that front foot
#   becomes OO. snicker_2 bobs head + paw + arm exactly 1 px down; tail,
#   haunches and feet stay put.
# caught: wide 2x2 eyes with the glint top-left in each eye (house convention,
#   as music_excited), O forearms from the shoulders to two cream paws held
#   together at the belly (the foot motif kwwk/kk twice, sharing a k seam),
#   front feet OO haunches, Y '!'.
# pant: droopy half-closed eyes (as idle wake), open mouth, tongue out;
#   pant_2 chest sinks 1 px, tongue 1 px shorter.

